  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have learned a technique to use your talons readily as working limbs while you focus on your wings to fly or maintain balance. Your talons become limbs that can carry and wield items and equipment. You can designate them as a pair of hands when you use the Switch Hands action. Through magic and a bit of technique if your hands are free, you can hover a few feet off the ground. Hovering in this way does not count as flying and your land speed represents how fast you move while hovering within a few feet of a solid surface, but you might be able to avoid certain types of difficult or hazardous terrain, at the GM’s discretion.</span></p>"
